      en: ["Located about 115 km east of Dubai city center.", "The Hatta Fort was originally constructed in 1896.", "The dam has a capacity of approximately 6 million gallons.", "Features over 30 km of dedicated mountain bike trails.", "Hatta Wadi Hub was opened as an adventure center in 2018.", "The region sits at an average elevation of 330 meters."],
